# workspace 下每个包都有自己的 node_modules（apps/*/node_modules 是指进宿主机 .pnpm 的符号链接），
# 只写 `node_modules` 只排得掉根目录那一个 —— 漏进来会在 `COPY . .` 时盖掉镜像里装好的依赖
**/node_modules
dist
apps/platform/dist
apps/collab/dist
packages/config/dist
packages/web/dist
packages/data-access/dist
packages/session/dist
packages/canvas/dist
packages/collab/dist
output
.git
.claude
.codegraph
.joycode
.agents
.vscode
k8s
ci
doc
snapshoot
*.log
.env
.env.local
server.config.*
data
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm

# 测试相关，不进镜像
apps/server/test
apps/agent-sandbox/test
apps/platform/test
apps/collab/test
apps/web/src/test
packages/*/test
vitest.config.ts
apps/*/vitest.config.ts
packages/*/vitest.config.ts
coverage
